# Read AGENTS.md first

Before non-trivial patches, read **`AGENTS.md`** at the repo root (architecture, Firestore R/W, ops, encyclopedia update steps).

Hard constraints (also in AGENTS.md):

- Patch **only** `sevennight_guild_web_formal`. Live = `https://senalink.web.app` (Firebase **`senalink`**).
- Deploy Hosting/rules/functions **only** when 밍봉/김봉 asks.
- Do not open old copies (`sevennight_guild_web`, `*_backup*`) or other Firebase projects.
- Deck editor: skill order list height fixed in px; scroll only in `.skill-timeline-scroller`.
- Bump `src/config/appVersion.js` when shipping a deploy.
